            %p
              In order to verify the axiom “
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/causal+additivity"}> causal additivity
              ”, observe, for convenience, that by
              %a{:href => "S-matrix#CausalFactorizationAlreadyImpliesSMatrix"} this prop.
